@startuml Deployment Creation

!define C4Container
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Container.puml

title Deployment Creation - Sequence Diagram

actor "User" as User
participant "Frontend\n[Container: React]" as Frontend
participant "Backend API\n[Container: FastAPI]" as Backend
database "PostgreSQL\n[Container: Database]" as Database

User -> Frontend: Formular ausfüllen und\n"Deployen" klicken
activate Frontend

Frontend -> Backend: POST /deployments\n{name, appId, releaseTag,\nuserInputVar, teams[]}
activate Backend

Backend -> Backend: get_current_user_keycloak()\nRolle und Rechte prüfen

Backend -> Backend: Freigabe der Version prüfen\n(Commit, Spec-Hash, Image-Digests)\nappstore.yaml am Commit lesen und validieren

Backend -> Backend: Eingaben prüfen\n(Variablen, Dateien: Endung, Inhalt,\nVirenscan, Upload-Kontingent)

Backend -> Database: Deployment, Teams und Mitglieder anlegen\n(Namespace dep-<8 hex> reservieren)
activate Database
Database --> Backend: deployment object
deactivate Database

alt kein aktiver Task (PENDING/RUNNING)

Backend -> Database: prepare_task_in_tx: Task (PENDING) mit\njob "pods.deploy_application" und job_kwargs\nin derselben Transaktion; Commit sendet\nNOTIFY task_queued
activate Database
Database --> Backend: task object
deactivate Database

Backend --> Frontend: 201 Created\nDeploymentResponse
deactivate Backend

Frontend --> User: Deployment angelegt,\nLive-Log öffnet sich (SSE)
deactivate Frontend

else aktiver Task vorhanden

Backend --> Frontend: 409 Conflict\n(höchstens ein aktiver Task je Deployment)
deactivate Backend
activate Frontend

Frontend --> User: Fehler: Es läuft bereits ein Task
deactivate Frontend

end

@enduml
